# Server secrets belong in Firebase Secret Manager, never in this file or client JavaScript.
# Required secrets: TICKET_SIGNING_KEY, MOYASAR_SECRET_KEY, MOYASAR_WEBHOOK_TOKEN,
# WHATSAPP_ACCESS_TOKEN.
# Firebase string parameters: PUBLIC_SITE_ORIGIN, WHATSAPP_PHONE_NUMBER_ID,
# WHATSAPP_INVITATION_TEMPLATE, WHATSAPP_REMINDER_TEMPLATE,
# WHATSAPP_GRAPH_API_VERSION.
# PUBLIC_SITE_ORIGIN defaults to https://medadtahaya.com.
# No database password is needed for Firestore.
# Public Firebase web configuration and the public App Check site key belong in js/firebase-config.js.
# Start with an sk_test_ Moyasar key; never paste sk_test_ or sk_live_ values into the repository.
